Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy See also: Feats When you get the drop on opponents, you dazzle them with your speed and ferocity. Prerequisite: Trained in Initiative Effect: During the Surprise Round, if you damage a Flat-Footed target, that target is also knocked Prone if your attack roll also exceeds the target's Fortitude Defense. The target adds its size modifier to its Fortitude Defense: 
 Colossal, +50; 
 Gargantuan, +20; 
 Huge, +10; 
 Large, +5; 
 Medium and smaller, +0.
